EmailTemplate.textOnly:
Hello,

Please contact us regarding your business loan. We have had several payments returned and have sent a messenger to reach out to you at the business location. If you are having difficulties making payments at this time, we do have temporary modification programs available. Please let us know if you would like more information about these programs.


Thank you,

{!User.Name} | {!User.Title}

{!Case.Email_Signature_Company__c}

{!$Setup.Company_Information__c.Street__c}
